The emoji-data.ts catalogue was authored for ERPForAll. Its arrangement, labels,
keywords and categories are distributed under the repository's MIT OR Apache-2.0
licence (LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE). No upstream emoji catalogue or font is
included. Unicode characters are rendered using the user's installed fonts.
This catalogue is a curated subset, not a complete Unicode emoji inventory.
